OL,3,GNEWSAGirl, 12, gets her own fashion
OL,4,Ashow billboard
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 12-year-old girl has been surprised
OL,7,Fwith her own billboard after
OL,8,Fcampaigning for greater disability
OL,9,Frepresentation in fashion.
OL,11,FCarmela Chillery-Watson MBE, from
OL,12,FWiltshire, lives with LMNA congenital
OL,13,Fmuscular dystrophy - a progressive
OL,14,Fmuscle-wasting condition.
OL,16,FOn Wednesday, she was given a surprise
OL,17,Fat the Arches on Cheltenham Road in
OL,18,FBristol, when she turned a corner with
OL,19,Fher family and saw herself on a
OL,20,Fbillboard for the very first time.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,350,340,200,160,0,100
