OL,3,GNEWSAGirl, 12, gets her own fashion
OL,4,Ashow billboard
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt was organised by the Bristol Fashion
OL,7,FShow, a volunteer-run collective of
OL,8,Fdesigners and artists from across the
OL,9,FSouth West who work to create a
OL,10,Fplatform "for those too often
OL,11,Foverlooked by the fashion industry".
